0..69 Comment "// Many models in scope: sixteen models of `Count`, each at a carrier"
70..149 Comment "// of its own, and one body calling `advanced` once at each carrier. Every call"
150..224 Comment "// leaves its model implicit out, so the checker tries each of the sixteen"
225..301 Comment "// candidates at each of the sixteen slots, against one solver store holding"
302..372 Comment "// all of their holes: the hotpath series\' `many candidates` workload."
373..375 Comment "//"
376..391 Comment "// - see: #2395"
